  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Cabinet Vétérinaire du Dr Jackowski, at 256 avenue Maréchal Lyautey in Cavalaire-sur-Mer, treats dogs, cats and exotic pets in the area. Very well rated: 4.8/5 from 85 reviews, and 100% recommended on its Facebook page, where the practice regularly posts news.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Dr Jackowski sees patients <strong>by appointment, Monday to Saturday morning</strong>, as stated on the <a href="https://facebook.com/jackowskijulia" rel="noopener">practice's Facebook page</a>. To book, call 04 94 46 58 82. For information, our own notes give Monday to Friday 9am-12pm and 3pm-7pm, and Saturday 9am-12pm.</p>
      <p>Sources disagree on appointments: the practice's Facebook page says "by appointment", while the Cavalaire-sur-Mer tourist office and Golfe de Saint-Tropez Tourisme say "no appointment needed" for the same hours (Monday-Friday 9am-12pm and 3pm-7pm, Saturday 9am-12pm, open all year). The safest option is to call before you come.</p>
      <p>Address as given by the tourist office: avenue du Maréchal Lyautey, Le Goéland 1 building. Directories say the practice sees dogs, cats and exotic pets and that the online booking site MonRendezVousVeto does not handle its appointments (phone only).</p>
      <h2>Emergencies and out-of-hours care</h2>
      <p>The practice does not itself advertise a 24/7 emergency service. In the area, Dr Tison's clinic (269 boulevard Pasteur, 04 94 64 08 52) states on its CaptainVet page that a 24/7 on-call service is shared on rotation between the vets of Cavalaire, La Croix-Valmer, Cogolin, Gassin, Saint-Tropez, Grimaud and Sainte-Maxime: at night or on Sundays, call a vet in the area, whose answering machine usually names the colleague on call. We have not confirmed that this practice takes part in the rotation.</p>
      <div class="callout">Worth checking before you go: whether an appointment is required (two versions) and whether the practice takes part in the gulf's on-call rota.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>A <a href="/en/fiche-toiletteur-cavalaire">groomer</a> and the <a href="/en/fiche-camping-cavalaire">Cavalaire campsite</a> are nearby if you're staying in the area with your dog. Dr Tison's clinic is the village's other one.</p>
